["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Service/KeyValidationProtocolType/crl", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "Certificate Revocation List, or CRL, is a list of revoked certificates as defined in [RFC 5280]](https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/rfc5280/) that is downloaded from the Certificate Authority (CA).", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
