["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/RelationshipType/hasContactPoint", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "The `from` Artifact has each `to` Agent as a contact point. The use of the `hasContactPoint` type is constrained to `ContactPointRelationship` classed relationships. The type of contact can be specified using a `contactType` property on the `to` Agent.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
